<title>USA: TABLE - Coastal Bancorp Q2 net down.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Coastal Bancorp Q2 net down.</headline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.55		    $0.60</p>
<p> Net			  2,819		    3,011</p>
<p> Total assets	 2,860,551		2,793,143</p>
<p> Return on equity	 11.55		    12.85</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.19		    $1.16</p>
<p> Net			  6,057		    5,804</p>
<p> Total assets	 2,864,523		2,792,517</p>
<p> Return on equity	 12.63		    12.52</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers. Return in equity is in percent.)</p>
<p>NOTES: Net income figures are net income after preferred stock dividends.</p>
<p>Decrease in Q2 1997 net income primarily due to $521,000 non-recurring gain, before taxes, from sale of branch office recorded during the 1996 quarter.</p>
